1d:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"把输入、输出和待优化对象建成 computation graph，先前向执行并依据目标取得评价，再沿依赖反向生成对各变量的文本 feedback。文本 optimizer 综合变量、角色和 feedback 提出更新，重新运行系统检验目标变化，迭代改进候选。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用原文 Prompt Optimization 场景：Prompt 与 Question 输入 Solver 得到 Prediction，Evaluator 给反馈；Backward 结合下游意见和局部上下文，为 Prompt 生成 Textual Gradient；Optimizer 修改 Prompt，再在独立样本上检查。原文还优化单题 Solution、代码、分子和治疗计划。这些 Variant 的输出与保留范围不同，单题修订不能被当成跨任务 Prompt Learning。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]
1e:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"数值 Chain Rule 中，dL/dx=(dL/dy)(dy/dx)，局部导数有确定含义。TextGrad 用文字反馈近似“x 应如何变化以改善 L”的作用，而没有可相乘的数值局部导数。因此不要把 Textual Gradient 的方向看成已证明的下降方向。理解它时应跟踪依赖图、反馈可见范围和更新后的重新评估。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"Numerical analogy: dL/dx = (dL/dy)·(dy/dx)\nTextGrad: downstream feedback + local context → textual advice\nvariable′ = edit(variable, advice); then re-evaluate"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"链式法则的数值例子是 y=2x、L=y²：x 增加一点先让 y 以两倍幅度变化，再通过 L 对 y 的斜率 2y 传到目标，所以 dL/dx=2y×2。TextGrad 借用了沿依赖关系追溯影响的组织方式，但文字建议没有对应的连续微小扰动或可验证导数。一次编辑可能同时改变语义、格式和边界行为。因此，收到看似合理的 Feedback 后仍要重新运行系统，检查 Loss 是否改善；不能将建议方向直接当作下降保证。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：图式文本反馈能否跨不同变量与目标有效优化？→ Experiment：在代码、推理、Prompt、分子和治疗计划等任务展示并比较优化结果。→ Answer：作者报告多种场景收益；每个实验有自己的目标函数和约束，不能将其中的分数合并成统一的通用优化能力。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"第 3.2 节通过 test-time 逐题修订答案，将 GPQA zero-shot 准确率从 51% 提至 55%；第 3.3 节另做可跨查询复用的 prompt optimization。代码、分子与治疗计划属于不同产物任务，不能将其指标统一解释为 model 自身能力增长。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"TextGrad 的价值是统一反馈传递接口。它提供可用的工程抽象，但局部语言归因的正确性、收敛与跨任务保留仍需按 Variant 单独验证。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是局部上下文足以识别全局错误原因。两个组件可能各自合理、组合后失效；单独修改任一组件都可能破坏原有配合。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"方法依赖 model 提供可靠的语义归因，没有真实 gradient 或收敛保证。分子相关结果主要来自计算评价，外部科学设计不能仅凭代理分数证明真实效果；foundation model 和文本优化流程也没有在实验中自主重写。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: TextGrad: Automatic \"Differentiation\" via Text · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：建立检索加回答的两节点系统，构造有明确错误来源的数据。Day 3–5：比较只改最终输出、只改 Prompt、图式反馈三组。Day 6–7：测隐藏问题，并人工检查反馈是否指向真正出错的节点。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"让两个节点约定一个内部编码，单独看中间结果像错误、联合输出却正确。若 Backward 按常识修正其中一个节点并破坏最终答案，就能展示局部解释与全局功能的冲突。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"后续相关工作 DoCtOR 已将失败归因、反事实步骤修正与定向 Reflection 结合，用于 Multi-Agent Collaboration。单独提出因果归因或定向反思已有接近的研究。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2608.28264v1",{"href":"#reference-2608.28264v1","aria-label":"来源 4: Finding Where the Buck Stops: An Automated Failure Attribution-Based Reflection Framework for Multi-Agent Collaboration","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究语言反馈的因果信用分配：在建议修改前，对中间节点做最小替换实验，判断哪个变化真正改变最终结果。相对 Self-Refine 的整段修订，这要求区分归因证据和编辑建议。评价应看定位准确率及错误更新减少量，而非只看最终多次尝试后的最高分。 提案应进一步面对多个错误相互抵消或共同致错的情况：在写入跨任务规则前，主动选择能区分竞争原因的干预，并检验规则在未见任务上的可识别性。若只定位单个决定性错误，研究就没有覆盖这个新增问题；是否足够新颖仍需更多相关工作检索。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2309.03409",{"href":"#reference-2309.03409","aria-label":"来源 2: Large Language Models as Optimizers","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2303.17651",{"href":"#reference-2303.17651","aria-label":"来源 3: Self-Refine: Iterative Refinement with Self-Feedback","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2608.28264v1",{"href":"#reference-2608.28264v1","aria-label":"来源 4: Finding Where the Buck Stops: An Automated Failure Attribution-Based Reflection Framework for Multi-Agent Collaboration","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
